# Environment files. .env is untracked; .env.example documents the keys.
# Nothing here is a secret in the usual case: Vite inlines `VITE_*` into the
# client bundle, so those values are public by design. A key that is NOT
# prefixed `VITE_` must never live in this file.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
